meta {
  name: Payment Summary (KPI Cards)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/finance/payments/summary
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~branchId: {{branchId}}
  ~dateFrom: 2026-07-01
  ~dateTo: 2026-07-31
  ~search: john
  ~type: DIRECT
  ~referralPanelId: {{referralPanelId}}
  ~referredByDoctorId: {{referralDoctorId}}
  ~internalReferralId: {{internalReferralId}}
  ~externalReferralId: {{externalReferralId}}
  ~userId: {{personId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Payment Summary — GET /finance/payments/summary

  KPI totals for the Finance → Payments summary cards over the active filters.
  Same tenant/branch/date/type/referral/user/search filters as the records list
  (**Payment Records**), but **ignores** `mode` and `status` — it always computes
  the full breakdown. Amounts are whole rupees.

  ```json
  {
    "totalPayments": 12000,   // cash + upi + bankTransfer + debitCard + creditCard (COMPLETED)
    "cash": 5000,
    "upi": 3000,
    "bankTransfer": 2000,
    "debitCard": 1000,        // PaymentMode CARD
    "creditCard": 1000,       // PaymentMode CREDIT
    "cancelledCount": 2,      // payments on CANCELLED orders/invoices
    "cancelledAmount": 1500,
    "refundedCount": 1,       // REFUND ledger rows (Direct only)
    "refundedAmount": 500
  }
  ```

  Wallet/Privilege/Loyalty are intentionally excluded (those cards are greyed on
  the FE for this phase). Run **Business Auth → Login** first.
}
